ent-MiningSlurryTank = liquid metal tank
    .desc = A compact industrial tank that stores liquid metal without electricity. Connect an ore duct beneath its center and anchor the tank to connect it to the network. Unanchoring preserves its contents.
ent-MiningSlurryTankLarge = industrial liquid metal tank
    .desc = A large 3×3 industrial tank that stores liquid metal without electricity. Connect an ore duct beneath its center and anchor the tank to connect it to the network. Unanchoring preserves its contents.
ent-MiningSlurryTankCircuitboard = liquid metal tank board
    .desc = A circuit board for a compact liquid metal tank.
ent-MiningSlurryTankLargeCircuitboard = industrial liquid metal tank board
    .desc = A circuit board for a large liquid metal tank. Requires a centered 3×3 machine frame.
ent-UnfinishedMachineFrame3x3Centered = centered machine frame (3×3)
    .desc = A machine under construction with its mounting point in the center. Needs more parts.
    .suffix = Unfinished
ent-MachineFrame3x3Centered = centered machine frame (3×3)
    .desc = A wired machine frame with its mounting point in the center.
    .suffix = Ready
ent-MachineFrameDestroyed3x3Centered = destroyed centered machine frame (3×3)
    .desc = The remains of a machine with its mounting point in the center. Can be salvaged with a welding tool.
